    rectangle "==Android bridge APK\n<size:16>[Container: Kotlin / Jetpack Compose]</size>\n\nOne UID and one process in this reference design; Kotlin service owns authoritative state" <<Element-RWxlbWVudA==>> as ReferenceAndroid.Androidphone.OneappUIDsandbox.AndroidbridgeAPK_1
    database "==App-private catalog/configuration\n<size:16>[Container: SQLite]</size>\n\nCatalog snapshots, client/principal mappings, grants/logging configuration, groups/views, journal and audit; secret keys remain in Keystore" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxEYXRhYmFzZQ==>> as ReferenceAndroid.Androidphone.OneappUIDsandbox.Appprivatecatalogconfiguration_1
